Subject: [PATCH 101/110] =?UTF-8?q?md:=20super=5F1=5Fvalidate/super=5F1=5F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?sync=20=E5=A4=84=E7=90=86=20LLBITMAP=5FCONVERTING=20=E4=B8=8E?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20ext=5Fstatus,=20bind=5Frdev=5Fto=5Farray=20=E7=BB=A7?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=89=BF=20FAST=5FRESCYNC?=
